{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your cult. Spread the mold. Watch the sky bloom with yellow eyes, click to decay beautifully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality is a thin scab over the void.   <br>It festers.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A yellow stain blooms at the edge of your vision.  <br>Alive. Hungry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>It whispers your name in the language of rot.  <br>You <i>obey</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cult of the Yellow King</i> is a cosmic horror idle game where you command a cult to summon the <i>Yellow King</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>With every click, you surrender another fragment of yourself: <i>memory, tongue, flesh</i>. Each prayer gnaws at your humanity.  <br>Each sacrifice bleeds you hollow. <br>  <br><strong>This is not a path to power, it is a descent into beautiful oblivion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IDLE MADNESS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generators whisper secrets that scar.   <br>Upgrades demand <i>teeth, skin, sanity.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A NARRATIVE OF UNMAKING </strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock fragmented tales of dread as you progress.   <br>Each milestone a fresh horror.    <br>Your skin crawls. Walls grow eyes.    <br>The sky bleeds yellow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PRESTIGE THROUGH DAMNATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ascend by shattering your progress.\u00a0   </strong> <br>Choose an elder curse. Begin again, deeper in devotion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOUNDS OF THE VOID </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black metal dirges by <i>Merhum</i>.    <br>Hymns for the end of reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE KING AWAITS </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mold has rooted in your throat.    <br>The stars blink shut.   <br><i>He</i> approaches\u2026   <br>   <br><strong>Click, and let the beautiful decay consume you.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4097050?t=1760483585","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097050/8a935e5d50ddbc7ba707a0c40f9d5fec342b8989/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760483585","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097050/f96f4e4546d2000d40a2d8ceb64c1a562e83e80e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760483585","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097050/f96f4e4546d2000d40a2d8ceb64c1a562e83e80e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760483585","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your cult. Spread the mold. Watch the sky bloom with yellow eyes, click to decay beautifully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality is a thin scab over the void.   <br>It festers.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A yellow stain blooms at the edge of your vision.  <br>Alive. Hungry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>It whispers your name in the language of rot.  <br>You <i>obey</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cult of the Yellow King</i> is a cosmic horror idle game where you command a cult to summon the <i>Yellow King</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>With every click, you surrender another fragment of yourself: <i>memory, tongue, flesh</i>. Each prayer gnaws at your humanity.  <br>Each sacrifice bleeds you hollow. <br>  <br><strong>This is not a path to power, it is a descent into beautiful oblivion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IDLE MADNESS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generators whisper secrets that scar.   <br>Upgrades demand <i>teeth, skin, sanity.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A NARRATIVE OF UNMAKING </strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock fragmented tales of dread as you progress.   <br>Each milestone a fresh horror.    <br>Your skin crawls. Walls grow eyes.    <br>The sky bleeds yellow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PRESTIGE THROUGH DAMNATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ascend by shattering your progress.\u00a0   </strong> <br>Choose an elder curse. Begin again, deeper in devotion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOUNDS OF THE VOID </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black metal dirges by <i>Merhum</i>.    <br>Hymns for the end of reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE KING AWAITS </strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mold has rooted in your throat.    <br>The stars blink shut.   <br><i>He</i> approaches\u2026   <br>   <br><strong>Click, and let the beautiful decay consume you.</strong></p>","developers":["Metaphor Games","NewMind Interactive"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3928030","name":"Cult of the Yellow King"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097050/493e352b7521ecebcdf35f9ef7ee85244d5dca89/header.jpg?t=1760483585","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4097050/1133304028/e609ae382f873d1976094fa46c8f9347b7a036c7/1760376334/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760376943","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4097050/1133304028/e609ae382f873d1976094fa46c8f9347b7a036c7/1760376334/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760376943","highlight":true,"hls_h